  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **It's Gonna Be (Alright)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Cold Blows the Wind**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: I'm Dancing in the Show Tonight, Polka Dot Tail, Final Alarm, Ocean Man, She Wanted to Leave [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1997-00-00** (recommended): source not stated; 14 songs; 75 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- It's a composite: tracks come from many different shows and years rather than from a single concert [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1997-00-00**: taped by Various; transferred by Various; source: Various [1]. Also: Compiled by Browntracker user Fuzzface in 2005-2007 as a mirror of a Ween studio album, using the best unreleased live versions [1]",
